<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem" open><summary><strong>1. What is the shelf life of your products? </strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">Most of our packaged items carry a shelf life of <strong>6–12 months</strong> from the date of manufacture. Perishable items like fresh produce or dairy have shorter shelf lives, which are clearly mentioned on each product page and on the packaging.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1.1rem"},"color":{"background":"#c2ecb1"}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem"><summary><strong>2. How should I store the products after purchase?</strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">Store products in a <strong>cool, dry place away from direct sunlight</strong>. Refrigerate perishable items such as dairy, fresh juices, or ready-to-eat meals as instructed on the label.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1.1rem"},"color":{"background":"#c2ecb1"}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem"><summary><strong>3. Are your products FSSAI certified?</strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">Yes, all food products we sell are <strong>FSSAI-certified</strong> and comply with current food safety standards.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1.1rem"},"color":{"background":"#c2ecb1"}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem"><summary><strong>4. How do I place an order?</strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">Simply browse our categories, add your desired items to the cart, and proceed to checkout. We offer <strong>secure payment options</strong> including credit/debit cards, UPI, and net banking.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1.1rem"},"color":{"background":"#c2ecb1"}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem"><summary><strong>5. What are the delivery timelines?</strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">Orders are typically dispatched within <strong>24 hours</strong> and delivered within <strong>2–5 working days</strong>, depending on your location. Delivery timelines are shown at checkout.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1.1rem"},"color":{"background":"#c2ecb1"}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem"><summary><strong>6. Do you offer same-day or express delivery?</strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">In select cities we provide <strong>same-day or next-day delivery</strong> for an additional fee. Check your pin code at checkout to see available options.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1.1rem"},"color":{"background":"#c2ecb1"}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem"><summary><strong>7. What is your return and replacement policy?</strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">We accept returns or replacements for items that are <strong>damaged, expired, or incorrect</strong> upon delivery. Please notify us within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> of receiving your order with photos for quick resolution.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1.1rem"},"color":{"background":"#c2ecb1"}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem"><summary><strong>8. Can I cancel my order?</strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">Yes, orders can be cancelled <strong>before dispatch</strong>. Once shipped, cancellation is no longer possible, but you may still be eligible for a return if the product arrives damaged.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1.1rem"},"color":{"background":"#c2ecb1"}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem"><summary><strong>9. Are there any delivery charges?</strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">Delivery is <strong>free above ₹X</strong> (set your threshold). Orders below that amount incur a small shipping fee, which is displayed at checkout.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1.1rem"},"color":{"background":"#c2ecb1"}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-background" style="background-color:#c2ecb1;font-size:1.1rem"><summary><strong>10. Do you offer eco-friendly packaging?</strong></summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block","style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"1rem"}},"backgroundColor":"base-2"} -->
<p class="has-base-2-background-color has-background" style="font-size:1rem">Yes! We use <strong>recyclable and eco-friendly packaging materials</strong> wherever possible to reduce environmental impact.</p>
